\newlabel{fig:sortfamily}{{7.2}{81}{What \texttt {sort}, \texttt {partial\_sort} and \texttt {nth\_element} guarantee. Grey cells are in an unspecified order; with \texttt {nth\_element}, blue cells are at most the value at index $k$ and orange cells at least it}{figure.caption.107}{}}
