\newlabel{fig:intervalsched}{{7.7}{86}{Earliest end first. Each interval is on its own row, in order of end time. The algorithm takes an interval whenever it starts at or after the end of the last one taken (dashed lines): four intervals, the maximum}{figure.caption.118}{}}
