\newlabel{fig:jobheap}{{7.11}{90}{Scheduling unit jobs with a min-heap. Whenever the heap holds more jobs than days available, the cheapest job is dropped. The final jobs are done on days 1, 2, 3 in order of deadline: profits 5, 8, 6}{figure.caption.123}{}}
