\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7.12}{\ignorespaces Regret greedy on the prices $3, 1, 4, 5, 2, 6$. The optimal plan buys on days 1, 2 and 5 and sells on days 3, 4 and 6, for a profit of 9. The duplicated prices are the options to move a sale to a later, better day.}}{91}{figure.caption.124}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:regret}{{7.12}{91}{Regret greedy on the prices $3, 1, 4, 5, 2, 6$. The optimal plan buys on days 1, 2 and 5 and sells on days 3, 4 and 6, for a profit of 9. The duplicated prices are the options to move a sale to a later, better day}{figure.caption.124}{}}
